---

## Notes

- All paths are configured for Google Colab with Drive mounted at `/content/drive/MyDrive/histo/`. Update `ROOT` and `DATA_DIR` at the top of each section when running locally.
- Stage 2 thresholds are conservative starting points. Inspect the distribution histograms and the rejected image grid before finalizing values.
- Stage 3 uses ImageNet pretrained weights without any domain-specific fine-tuning. The ensemble output should be treated as a high-confidence screening signal and not as a replacement for expert pathological review.
- The notebook is designed to be run one class folder at a time. Update `FOLDER_NAME` or `DATA_DIR` at the start of each stage to process a different class.
